vpn-gate (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release: bash CLI installer (install-vpn-gate.sh) and
    GTK4/libadwaita GUI for managing VPN-gated applications.
  * Works with any VPN client (WireGuard, Amnezia, OpenVPN, Tailscale, ...)
    via a configurable network interface name.
  * Launch-block event log with a viewer in the GUI.
  * Adaptive window sizing based on screen resolution.
  * Launch a protected app with custom command-line arguments from the GUI.
  * Custom application icon, .desktop integration, autostart support.
  * MIT-licensed; packaged as a Debian .deb (packaging/build-deb.sh).

